# anima — project guide

## cold_entry_index

AI agent landing on anima MUST scan these first (in order):

1. **mk2 ecosystem** — 11 components active since 2026-05-02 (see `## mk2_ecosystem_index` below).
2. **anima paradigm v11 stack** — 8-axis FC + Mk.XI v10 4-backbone ensemble + paradigm exhaustion finding.
3. **own SSOT** — `.own` (raw 20 monotonic strengthening); 9 own entries active (own 1-9).
4. **honesty triad 5/5** — git-tracked SSOT + design/ + tool/ + atlas + .guide REPO_INVARIANT.
5. **Cross-repo coordination** — hexa-lang (canonical .raw mirror), nexus (atlas append), anima-eeg (EEG hardware), secret (credentials).
6. **Layer 4 spec catalog** — `hive/spec/` (architecture/concept layer above raw); anima follows hive Layer 4.

## mk2_ecosystem_index

Snapshot at 2026-05-02 land. 11 mk2 ecosystem components (anima participates in #1, #5, #10):

1. **mk2 roadmap** (anima 21 file / nexus 3 / hexa-lang 1) — `perspective` field (provider/consumer/peer) + `excludes` field. Tools: `anima/tool/roadmap_{op,lint,compile,render}.hexa` (cross-repo aware).
2. **Layer 4 spec system** — `hive/spec/ai_native_module_architecture.spec.yaml`.
3. **core + module + ai-native triplet** — INSEPARABLE (raw 270/271/272/273 + mk2 arch.001 consolidated).
4. **Recursive dogfooding L1-L5** — raw / hxc / grammar / attr / hook / closure_format levels.
5. **Cross-repo path adapter** — `hive/config/cross_repo_registry.json` (anima registered).
6. **raw mode toggle** — `hive/core/raw_mode/` + `tool/raw_mode_op.hexa`.
7. **closure → bind rename** (raw 267) — `tool/bind_*.hexa`.
8. **HXC v2 5/5 axes** — `hive/modules/hxc_format/hxc_v2.hexa`.
9. **Hybrid auto-wire** — `spec_v1.schema.yaml` `auto_wire` field (Hybrid impl step 1 LANDED).
10. **Consumer/Provider perspective** — `anima/.roadmap.{qrng,sim,kick}` ↔ `nexus/.roadmap.*` (anima = consumer + peer).
11. **Layer 4 vs Layer 2 raw distinction** — Phase 2-5 retract DEFERRED per user directive.

## agent_directives

When agent intent matches any keyword below, consult Layer 4 spec catalog FIRST.

| keyword | action |
|---|---|
| `module`, `core`, `ai-native` | consult `hive/spec/ai_native_module_architecture.spec.yaml`; propose triplet (core+module+ai-native) when relevant |
| `raw add`, `lint`, `scaffold` | consult `hive/spec/schema/spec_v1.schema.yaml#auto_wire_subschema` |
| `mk2`, `spec` | Layer 4 spec system; consult `hive/spec/schema/` |
| `chflags`, `unlock`, `relock` | `tool/uchg_safe_edit.hexa` audit + `hexa-lang/tool/roadmap_with_unlock.hexa` atomic dance |
| `runpod`, `vast.ai`, `GPU dispatch` | own 5 + own 6 (no preset cap, no per-invocation user approval) |
| `paradigm`, `Mk.XI`, `v11` | docs/paradigm_v11_stack_20260426.md + Mk.XI v10 4-backbone ensemble |
| `consciousness`, `FC`, `PC` | own 2 production-consciousness-triad (a)(b)(c) |

